  "description": "When WTB approached us about building a bike around their new Horizon 650b x 47mm TCS tires, we balked at first. Another wheel/tire size!?? But when we really looked at the advantages this combination offered we had to try it. Because this tire ends up with the same outside diameter as a 700 x 30c tire, we could keep the geometry nice and tight like a road bike. Sooo.....lighter/stronger wheels, quicker handling, and bigger volume. As Jackie Treehorn himself said, \"The wave of the future, Dude.\"\n\n- 2 Coat Powder Paint With Iron Phosphate Pre-Treatment\n- Complete Custom Fitting\n- Externally Butted Head Tube\n- Frame Delivered Fully Prepped And Ready To Assemble With Rust Inhibitor Sprayed Inside Seat Tube And On All Bare Metal Surfaces\n- Gusseted Head Tube/Downtube Junction (where applicable)\n- Reinforced Seat Collar Insert\n- Rider Specific Tubeset\n- Sealed Tubeset (no vent holes)\n- Sloping Top Tube Standard\n- Stainless Steel Cable Stops And Brake Line Guides\n- Stamped head badge\n- Tig Welded Frame",
